  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Practical open tool for digitising historical paper ECG archives — a real bottleneck in cardiology AI research where large historical collections exist only on paper. Uses semantic segmentation with perspective correction; configurable for any 12-lead subset. Peer-reviewed in npj Digital Medicine 2026. 87 stars, versioned releases (v1.9.3 June 2026), institutional backing from Akershus University Hospital AIM Lab. Training dataset separately available on HuggingFace (Apache-2.0). Assess rather than Adopt for two reasons: CC BY-SA 4.0 is a non-standard software licence (Creative Commons discourages CC for code; not OSI-approved; ShareAlike restricts commercial derivative works), and approximately half the codebase is Jupyter notebooks, limiting reuse as a clean Python library. Assess for research pipelines digitising historical ECG collections; verify licence compatibility before embedding in commercial workflows.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-06-04",
